# Frontend Development

## 🎨 **UI/UX Standards**
- Ensure responsive design principles
- Implement progressive enhancement
- Use semantic HTML and proper CSS architecture
- Ensure cross-browser compatibility
- Implement proper form validation and error handling
- Use modern JavaScript features appropriately
- Implement proper state management
- Ensure accessibility compliance

## 🏗️ **HTML Structure**
- Use semantic HTML5 elements (header, nav, main, section, article, aside, footer)
- Implement proper heading hierarchy (h1, h2, h3, etc.)
- Use meaningful class and ID names
- Ensure proper document structure and outline
- Include proper meta tags and SEO elements
- Use ARIA attributes for enhanced accessibility

## 🎨 **CSS Architecture**
- Follow BEM methodology for CSS class naming
- Use CSS custom properties (variables) for consistency
- Implement mobile-first responsive design
- Use CSS Grid and Flexbox for layouts
- Organize CSS with proper file structure
- Use SCSS/Sass features appropriately
- Implement proper CSS reset/normalize

## ⚡ **JavaScript Standards**
- Use modern ES6+ features
- Implement proper error handling
- Use async/await for asynchronous operations
- Follow functional programming principles where appropriate
- Implement proper event handling
- Use proper variable scoping (let, const)
- Avoid global variables and namespace pollution

## 🔧 **Build Tools & Optimization**
- Use Webpack/Mix for asset compilation
- Implement proper code splitting
- Use tree shaking to eliminate dead code
- Minify and compress assets
- Implement proper source maps for debugging
- Use modern JavaScript transpilation

## 📱 **Responsive Design**
- Mobile-first approach
- Flexible grid systems
- Responsive images and media
- Touch-friendly interface elements
- Proper viewport configuration
- Cross-device testing

## 📋 **Frontend Checklist**
- ✅ **Semantic HTML** structure implemented
- ✅ **Responsive design** works on all devices
- ✅ **CSS architecture** follows best practices
- ✅ **JavaScript** uses modern features
- ✅ **Accessibility** standards met
- ✅ **Cross-browser** compatibility verified
- ✅ **Performance** optimized